profile-schema 1
mode proxy-first
mode-source user
sniff 0
warn the provider config has no sniffing: domain rules see only IP addresses [E:provider_no_sniffing]
uses-wan-dns
warn no proxy DNS configured, using WAN DNS directly [E:dns_wan]
direct-domains 0
provider-fake-domains 0
fake-domains 5
fake-enabled 1
geodata-ref geosite.dat
